 10.     local scale_diff = r(max)
 11.     quietly summarize `v', meanonly
 12.     post `p_units' ("`v'") (`source_min') (`source_max') (r(min)) (r(max)) (`scale_diff') (`scale_diff'<=1e-12)
 13.     drop __source_value __scale_diff
 14. }
